        defenseRole: "Other neighbor",
        defenseExam: [.direct("Was there a feud between {D} and {V}?", "\"Over a fence line. They argued about the driveway and the fence, and it got loud a couple of times.\""), .direct("Did you see the hooded figure that night?", "\"Hooded, yes. I saw someone in a hood on {V}'s driveway, but I could not tell who it was.\""), .direct("Was asphalt sealer common on your street?", "\"Several houses had it. A roofing crew was working on a few homes that month, and they left buckets around.\""), .direct("How do you know about the roofers?", "\"I live across the street and watched a crew work on {D}'s roof for two days. They left buckets, tarps, and a ladder on the lawn.\""), .direct("What did you see that night?", "\"Nothing at all. I was asleep, and my own camera only catches the far side of the street, not either house.\""), .direct("How would you describe the neighbors' relationship?", "\"Strained over the driveway. I have heard a few shouting matches between them, but nothing that turned physical.\""), .cross("Did footprints reach the defendant's door?", "\"Part way. They led toward {DF}'s porch, but I did not follow them the whole way.\""), .cross("Did you see the defendant with a bucket?", "\"No. I did not see {D.him} with a bucket that night.\""), .cross("Did you hear the defendant threaten {V}?", "\"No. I heard them argue. I did not hear threats.\""), .cross("You did not see the painting, did you?", "\"No. I know only what the deputies and the neighbors told me the next day.\""), .cross("The footprints led to the defendant's porch, didn't they?", "\"So I heard. I did not see them myself, but several neighbors talked about it.\"")],
