        openings: ("{V}'s garage door and mailbox post were smeared with black asphalt sealer overnight. A porch camera shows a hooded figure at 1:15 a.m., black footprints lead to {D}'s porch, and a bucket of sealer with a wet brush sat there.", "Listen for the defense evidence, which will show that a roofing crew left a bucket on {D}'s porch, that sealer was common on the street, and that no one saw {D}'s face."),
