        defenseRole: "Tailgate bystander",
        defenseExam: [.direct("What started the argument at the tailgate?", "\"A parking space. {D} and {V} both wanted the same spot, and it escalated from there.\""), .direct("Did {D} take out a canister?", "\"Yes. {D.He} pulled a small canister out of a pocket and raised it. I saw it clearly.\""), .direct("Was {V} yelling at the defendant?", "\"Both of them were yelling. {V} was loud and in {DF}'s face, and {DF} was loud too.\""), .direct("What did you see?", "\"I was at the next tailgate and saw two people arguing loudly. I saw one pull something small out of a pocket and spray.\""), .direct("Which way did the spray go?", "\"Toward the argument, and a cloud spread out over several people. I think a dog barked at about the same time.\""), .direct("What happened afterward?", "\"People ran away coughing and calling for medics. I stayed back by my truck until the cloud cleared and the security officers came.\""), .cross("Did you get sprayed yourself?", "\"A little. I got a whiff of it and coughed, and my eyes stung for a few minutes.\""), .cross("Did the defendant aim at a dog or at {V}?", "\"It looked like {V}. The spray went right where {V} was standing.\""), .cross("Did you see a dog in the lot?", "\"There was a dog far across the lot. It was nowhere near the argument.\""), .cross("You did not see a dog near {V}, did you?", "\"No. I saw a stray at the far end of the lot earlier, but not near the argument when the spray came.\""), .cross("The canister was aimed at {V}, wasn't it?", "\"It looked that way to me, though everything happened fast and the wind was shifting.\"")],
