        openings: ("A high school stadium closed to the public after 6 p.m., with signs on the gate. At 8:30, {D} and three friends climbed the gate, played flag football under the lights, and stayed through two requests to leave.", "The defense will present evidence that the lights were on from an earlier practice, that the sign was faded, and that {D} thought the field was open."),
        closings: ("A closed gate, a posted notice, a climb over the fence, and two requests to leave that were refused. {D} stayed until deputies came.", "Lights left on, a faded sign, and a game among friends. The State must prove {D} knew the field was closed, and the evidence shows confusion."),
        timeline: [(0, "8:30 p.m.: {D} climbs the gate."), (0, "8:45 p.m.: the custodian asks the group to leave."), (0, "9:15 p.m.: deputies arrive."), (1, "The school sends the camera video.")],
