        exam: [.direct("What was happening on the highway at 5:40 p.m.?", "\"Traffic on a four-lane stretch was stopped for a crash. {D} came up on a motorcycle and rode onto the shoulder and between lanes.\""), .direct("How fast was {D} going?", "\"80 miles per hour on the shoulder at 5:42, by radar. {D.He} passed stopped cars within inches.\""), .direct("How was the defendant stopped?", "\"Two drivers called 911, and I stopped {D.him} at 5:55 after a chase of about two miles. The helmet camera shows the speedometer.\""), .direct("What was the traffic like at 5:40?", "\"A crash had closed two lanes and cars were stopped bumper to bumper on a four-lane highway. Drivers had their engines off and some were standing beside their doors.\""), .direct("What did your radar show?", "\"A motorcycle on the shoulder at 80 miles per hour at 5:42. It was passing stopped cars close enough that a driver flinched.\""), .direct("How did the stop go?", "\"I chased for about two miles with lights on, and {D.he} pulled over at 5:55. {D.He} gave me the helmet camera without argument.\""), .cross("{D} says {D.he} was only riding at the speed of traffic, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"Traffic was moving slowly before the crash. But it was stopped at the crash site, and {D.he} was doing 80.\""), .cross("Was anyone struck?", "\"No. No car was touched, and no one was hurt. It was close, but there was no contact.\""), .cross("Did the defendant post the ride online?", "\"I understand {DL} posted video of it. I did not see that myself.\""), .cross("Traffic had been moving slowly before the crash, hadn't it?", "\"Yes, at around ten or fifteen miles an hour at 5:30. After the crash it stopped completely, so the speed of traffic was zero.\""), .cross("No car was struck, was it?", "\"No contact. The helmet camera shows passes within inches, but none touched.\"")],
        defenseRole: "Stopped driver",
        defenseExam: [.direct("Did the motorcycle pass you fast?", "\"Very. I did not hear it coming, and then it was just there, going by at a speed I could not believe.\""), .direct("How close did the motorcycle come to your car?", "\"Inches. I saw the rider's sleeve go by my mirror, and I held my breath until it was gone.\""), .direct("Was there room on the shoulder for a motorcycle?", "\"Barely. The shoulder was narrow, and cars were crowded against it, so there was almost no space to pass.\""), .direct("How were you stopped?", "\"I was driving a sedan in the stopped line when a motorcycle zipped by on the shoulder. A trooper stopped me later for a minor matter.\""), .direct("What did you see of the motorcycle?", "\"It passed on the right at a very high speed. It was gone in a couple of seconds, and I flinched.\""), .direct("What did you do?", "\"I called 911 and described the motorcycle and where it was headed. A second caller did the same.\""), .cross("Did the rider slow down at all that you saw?", "\"No. The rider did not slow down. The motorcycle kept the same speed all the way past the stopped cars.\""), .cross("Were you frightened by the pass?", "\"Yes. I thought for a second I would be hit. I was shaking when I called 911.\""), .cross("Was traffic moving before the crash?", "\"Slowly, yes. It was crawling, then it stopped when the crash happened ahead.\""), .cross("You did not see the speedometer, did you?", "\"No. I judged it by how fast it passed my car.\""), .cross("Our lane was stopped completely, wasn't it?", "\"Yes. We had not moved in several minutes.\"")],
        theory: ("{D} weaved at high speed past stopped cars.", "{D} rode at the speed of traffic."),
