        defenseRole: "Neighbor at the old address",
        defenseExam: [.direct("How do you know {D}?", "\"I live next door to {D}'s old address. We were neighbors for about six years before {D.he} moved.\""), .direct("Do you recall mail going to the old address?", "\"Yes. After {D.he} moved, some mail kept coming to the house. I put it in a stack or returned it to the carrier.\""), .direct("What did you do with the mail?", "\"If it was obviously for {D.him}, I wrote return to sender and left it for the carrier. I don't remember each piece.\""), .direct("Did the defendant renew licenses by mail in the past?", "\"I recall {D.he} saying it was easy, just a form and a check. That was a few years back.\""), .direct("Did the defendant ever mention an eye exam?", "\"No. {D.He} never said anything about one to me.\""), .direct("Did the defendant seem to know the license had lapsed?", "\"No. {D.He} was shocked when the citation came. {D.He} came over and showed me the paper.\""), .cross("Did you see the DMV letter?", "\"I do not remember a DMV letter specifically. I can't say which letters went through my hands.\""), .cross("Did the defendant give you a forwarding address?", "\"I believe so, but I don't have it. We lost touch for a while.\""), .cross("Did {D} drive during that time?", "\"I saw {D.his} car at the old house for a while, but I can't say when {D.he} drove.\""), .cross("How often did you see the defendant after the move?", "\"Rarely. A few times a year at the grocery store.\""), .cross("Do you know whether the card was expired?", "\"No. I only learned that after the stop.\"")],
