        defenseRole: "Fellow customer",
        defenseExam: [.direct("Did you see {D} take the phone and wallet?", "\"I saw {D} pick them up from the table. It looked casual, like someone picking up their own things.\""), .direct("Did the defendant look around before picking them up?", "\"Not really. {D.He} did not look around or act sneaky at all, which is why I did not say anything.\""), .direct("Did {D} have a phone of {D}'s own at the laundromat?", "\"Yes. I saw {DF} using one earlier that evening, and it looked like the same model as the other phone.\""), .direct("What did you see at the laundromat?", "\"I saw {DF} folding clothes at a table, and another person set down a phone and wallet next to the pile. I was at the machines.\""), .direct("What did the defendant do?", "\"Picked up items and put them in a bag. It looked casual, not furtive.\""), .direct("Do you remember the phones?", "\"Two phones in similar cases were on the tables. It would be easy to mix them up.\""), .cross("Did the defendant leave quickly after picking up the phone and wallet?", "\"Yes. {D.He} left soon afterward with the laundry bag, and I did not think anything of it then.\""), .cross("Did you tell {D} that the phone on the table was not {D.his}?", "\"No. I did not think about it at that moment. I assumed {DF} knew which phone was which.\""), .cross("Did you see the defendant use a card from the wallet?", "\"No. I did not see that. I only saw {DF} pick things up and leave the laundromat.\""), .cross("You did not see the defendant look at the phone, did you?", "\"No. I looked away.\""), .cross("The wallet was a different color, wasn't it?", "\"I do not remember. I was not watching closely.\"")],
