        defenseRole: "Friend at the store",
        defenseExam: [.direct("Did {D} say why {D.he} took the bottles of wine?", "\"A joke. {D} said it was meant as a joke, to see if anyone in the store would notice anything.\""), .direct("Did the defendant plan to pay for the wine at the register?", "\"I do not know. {D.He} did not tell me what the plan was, and I did not ask in the moment.\""), .direct("Did you try to stop the defendant at the shelf before leaving?", "\"No. I did not. I thought {DF} was just fooling around, and I did not think it was serious.\""), .direct("How do you know the defendant?", "\"We were shopping together that evening. I was in the next aisle.\""), .direct("What did you see?", "\"I saw {DF} picking up two bottles and tucking them under a jacket. I thought {DF} was heading to pay.\""), .direct("What did the defendant say?", "\"That the registers were backed up. {D.He} had cash in hand.\""), .cross("Did {D} hide the bottles under the jacket?", "\"Under a jacket, yes. They were tucked away and not carried openly in the hands, as you would carry them to pay.\""), .cross("Did the defendant head toward the register at any point?", "\"I think so, but {DF} also headed toward the exit. I could not say which way {DF} decided.\""), .cross("Did the defendant say anything about not having an ID that day?", "\"I heard {DF} did not have one with {D.him}. I do not know any more about that than I have said.\""), .cross("You saw the defendant walk past the registers, didn't you?", "\"Yes, I did. I did not think of it as stealing.\""), .cross("You did not stop the defendant, did you?", "\"No. I was reading a label.\"")],
