        defenseRole: "Tenant on the third floor",
        defenseExam: [.direct("Did you hear the grinder from your apartment?", "\"Loudly. It shook my window, and I could not sleep through it.\""), .direct("What time was it when you heard the noise?", "\"About two in the morning. I looked at my clock and it was just after two.\""), .direct("Did you complain to the manager?", "\"Yes. I called the manager that night and asked for something to be done about it.\""), .direct("Where do you live?", "\"On the third floor of the building next to the lot. My window faces the parking area.\""), .direct("What did you hear?", "\"A loud compressor and a grinder starting around two. I could not sleep.\""), .direct("What did you do?", "\"I called the manager and later the deputies. The noise kept going for nearly an hour.\""), .cross("Did you see who was making the noise?", "\"From my window, I saw someone working under a light in the lot.\""), .cross("Was it {D}?", "\"I think so. I could not see the face, but it was the car that belongs to {D}.\""), .cross("Had the noise happened on earlier nights too?", "\"Once or twice before. Not this loud.\""), .cross("You had work in the morning too, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I was exhausted the next day.\""), .cross("You did not go down and talk to the defendant, did you?", "\"No. I did not want a confrontation at that hour.\"")],
        theory: ("{D} ran loud tools after quiet hours.", "{D} needed the car for work."),
