        summary: "{V} moved out of a rental on {DATE} leaving the apartment clean. {D}, the landlord, sent a letter two weeks later keeping the $1,500 deposit and billing $500 more for repairs, with an invoice from a contractor. The contractor's license number does not exist in the state records and the phone is {D}'s. {D} says a friend did the work.",
        state: [E(.document, 3, "Repair Invoice", "An invoice for $2,000 from a contractor with a license number not in the state database."), E(.document, 3, "Move-Out Photos", "Date-stamped photos of a clean unit with no damage."), E(.digital, 2, "Phone Record", "The contractor's number rings to {D}'s phone."), E(.statement, 2, "{V}", "Left the unit clean and took photos.")],
        defense: [E(.statement, 1, "Friend Did the Work", "{DL} says a friend did the work and used an old license number."), E(.document, 1, "Cash Receipt", "A cash receipt for $400 for paint and materials.")],
